				{
					"id": 750000606,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，那就輪到我出場的時候啦…{F#妳}{M#你}的背包裡滿滿的，關鍵時刻找個東西也要找半天。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000607,
					"content": "就用「派蒙應急小背包」裡的這條絲巾稍微包紮一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000608,
					"content": "妳的背包到底在哪裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000609,
					"content": "哼，當然是藏在不能隨便被發現的地方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000610,
					"content": "#欸呀，這條絲巾{F#妳}{M#你}到底要不要用啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000611,
					"content": "要用，謝謝派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000612,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小傢伙？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000613,
					"content": "小傢伙，不要動哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000614,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，{NICKNAME}，沒想到牠還滿乖的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000615,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000616,
					"content": "這樣就好了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000617,
					"content": "怎麼樣，小傢伙，覺得好一點了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000618,
					"content": "呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000619,
					"content": "好了，小傢伙看起來也很有精神…真是鬆了口氣。不過你到底為什麼被關進那個罩子裡呀？還有…還有那些獸境獵犬…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000620,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000621,
					"content": "你也不知道啊…就算你知道，你「呀啊呀啊」的我們也聽不懂就是了…不過小傢伙，我們把你救出來了，你可以回家啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000622,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000623,
					"content": "咦，難道不知道自己的家在哪裡嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000624,
					"content": "那你的親人…啊，難道…剛才的大傢伙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000625,
					"content": "#那怎麼辦，{NICKNAME}…總不能把牠一個人…呃一個傢伙丟在這裡吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000626,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000627,
					"content": "是可以先跟著我們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000628,
					"content": "也是啦…說不定到了納塔就可以找到小傢伙的家人了…不過我們之前還沒有看過跟小傢伙一樣的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000629,
					"content": "啊，「受龍…所選者…」，難道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000630,
					"content": "#嗯…{F#妳}{M#你}說似乎看到了這樣的話？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000631,
					"content": "這麼說來，納塔是龍的國度吧？咦，難道…小傢伙也是…龍？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000632,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000633,
					"content": "這樣說來，看起來真的和龍蜥滿像的，都有…兩條腿和一條尾巴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000634,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000635,
					"content": "讓牠跟著我們是沒問題啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000636
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000636,
					"content": "不過要問問看牠同不同意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000637,
					"content": "說的也是。小傢伙，你願意跟我們一起旅行嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000638,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000639,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000640,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，小傢伙同意啦。對了，我是派蒙！{M#他}{F#她}是{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000641,
					"content": "啵嗯？呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000642,
					"content": "對了，小傢伙也要有個名字…讓我想想，看你顏色黃黃黑黑的，那就叫你「薯餅」吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000643,
					"content": "嗚…嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000644,
						750000646
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000644,
					"content": "大概只會在獵鹿人受歡迎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000645
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000645,
					"content": "「在其他地方就不受歡迎」的意思是吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000647
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000647,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000648
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000648,
					"content": "#你想要{NICKNAME}幫你取名字？這傢伙的取名品味…我不好說哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000649,
						750000650
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000649,
					"content": "明明我取的名字一向很正常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750000650,
					"content": "可憐的孩子…命中該有此劫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750000646,
					"content": "牠好像不是很喜歡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000647
					]
				}
			]
		},
