					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000903,
					"content": "…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000904,
					"content": "#看來牠很喜歡這個名字耶…嘿嘿，希望在納塔能夠解開你身上的謎團…對了，還有{NICKNAME}突然就能夠鑽到龍身體裡的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000905,
					"content": "#剛才都忘了問，{NICKNAME}{F#妳}{M#你}突然就變成龍，沒出什麼事吧？有沒有覺得不舒服？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000906,
						750000908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000906,
					"content": "有點暈龍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000907,
					"content": "#暈龍是什麼啦！還有空開玩笑，下次不理{F#妳}{M#你}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000910,
					"content": "#不過{NICKNAME}，我之前都沒聽說納塔有人能夠變成龍…感覺有點怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000911,
					"content": "真是的，才剛到納塔就發生了這麼多事…好了，接下來的問題就是…我們要怎麼出去呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000912,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000913,
					"content": "嗯？你知道要從哪裡出去嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000908,
					"content": "我是龍，也不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000909
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000909,
					"content": "最好是這樣啦，要是哪天變成龍的樣子回不來，到時候就麻煩了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
